# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Not a song: a jingle, played once as a sound (like music/jingles/victory.scrim). A stinger for a level gained (now the sfx `levelUp`, game/enemies.js): short, over the music.
# Not played by the game yet: only in tools/player.html, under Jingles.
title    Level up
composer Claude
about    A level gained: a crystal sweep up and the bird's call, then its call again an octave higher, over a glass harmonica chord.
tempo    100
beats    2
steps    6
reverb   0.5

# mood explore: bird sweep harm tap

voice bird     crystal    vol=0.55 pan=0.3  rev=0.7
voice sweep    crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.3 rev=0.6
voice harm     glassharp  vol=0.22 pan=0    center=A4 att=0.1 rel=1
voice tap      glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.35

pattern up
bird    | E6 A5+B5---- E7 A6+B6---- |
sweep   | A4 E5 A5 B5 .- E6 A6 B6 E7 .- |
harm    | [Aadd9]----------- |
tap     | x..... X..... |

loop up
